traits.desc:
(@MinUnits@) Your champions gain a @ShieldRatio*100@% max Health shield and deal @BonusMagicDamage*100@% bonus magic damage. Gain additional bonuses for each unique 3-star champion:

1 : Increase shield and magic damage by @PercentIncreasePer3Star*100@% for each 3-star.
@NumThreeStarThreshold1@ : @Threshold1AttackSpeed*100@% and @Threshold1ArmorMagicResist@
@NumThreeStarThreshold2@ : Convert @Threshold2TrueDamageConversion*100@% of the bonus magic damage to true damage.
@NumThreeStarThreshold3@ : Every @Threshold3StarUpPeriod@ seconds of combat, a 3-star champion ascends to 4-star.

